version: "2.1.2-SNAPSHOT"
abstract: >-
  Unfallwerkbank is an open-source browser and server toolkit for exploring,
  filtering, visualising and exporting official German road accident open data.
  It supports interactive Leaflet maps, cluster and heatmap views, context-aware
  filtering, local political request drafts, PDF/Word exports, optional AI-assisted
  assessment and an optional Spring Boot analysis service for persistent location
  action briefs and prioritisation.
keywords:
